ty — a confidential meeting, an\nair-gapped machine, or simply a preference not to rent your own voice.\n\nIt also transcribes recordings (`yazses transcribe talk.m4a`, with optional\nspeaker labels) and can capture a whole meeting into a speaker-labelled\ntranscript with locally generated minutes.","moniker":"yazses","name":"YazSes","packageUrl":"https://mskazemi.com/yazses/","publisher":"MSKazemi","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses/releases/tag/v2.39.1","tags":["voice","dictation","voice-typing","speech-to-text","speech-recognition","whisper","transcription","offline","on-device","privacy","accessibility","productivity","open-source"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi","releaseDate":"2026-09-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses/releases/tag/v2.39.1","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.6.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/MSKazemi/YazSes/2.39.1/MSKazemi.YazSes.yaml","sha256":"3656df2b5413e8fd38777e4f74108bbeb518c6be3cfb30a651ff61fb1f505dc2"},{"path":"manifests/m/MSKazemi/YazSes/2.39.1/MSKazemi.YazSes.installer.yaml","sha256":"e7a98f3a0f20bef78a79271971ea42e364b63c13d99b99927d58edb988c278c0"},{"path":"manifests/m/MSKazemi/YazSes/2.39.1/MSKazemi.YazSes.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"83b797d189712751b0ea8d1b84dd1b5f097d772453540acd4411eec62634deaa"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"2.39.1"}